  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n## 2026-09-10 - 10.0.0.3-Beta-01\n\n- Added structured diagnostics for transaction SNS FIFO routing and audit SQS publishing.\n\n## 2026-08-20 - 10.0.0.2-Beta-04\n- Test pkg for dualstack\n\n## 2026-08-20 - 10.0.0.2-Beta-03\n\n- Updated keyed cache registration to use the required structured logger.\n\n## 2026-08-19 - 10.0.0.2-Beta-02\n- Cherrypicked changes from 8.0.0.6-Beta-1 \n\n## 2026-08-18 - 10.0.0.2-Beta-01\n\n- Replaced obsolete Redis cache implementations with a shared keyed cache service.\n\n## 2026-08-14 - 10.0.0.1\n\n-  Published the Stable .net 10 compatible version\n\n## 2026-08-13 10.0.0.0-Beta-09\n- Updated README.md file",
